---
import Icon from './ReaderIcon.astro';
---
<section class="rail-card" id="tools-card">
  <h2 class="rail-heading">提问 / 批注 <small>本地工具</small></h2>
  <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="阅读工具">
    <button type="button" class="tab" id="question-tab" role="tab" aria-controls="question-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">提问</button>
    <button type="button" class="tab" id="notes-tab" role="tab" aria-controls="notes-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">批注</button>
  </div>
  <div id="question-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="question-tab">
    <form id="question-form"><div class="composer">
      <div class="quote-preview" id="question-quote" hidden><span></span><button type="button" data-clear-quote="question" aria-label="取消问题引用">×</button></div>
      <label class="sr-only" for="question-input">围绕本文提问</label>
      <textarea id="question-input" maxlength="1000" placeholder="有什么问题或想法？可以围绕本文内容提问…" required></textarea>
      <div class="composer-actions"><button type="button" class="quote-button" data-quote="question" aria-label="引用选中的原文"><Icon name="quote" /></button><button type="submit" class="solid-button">暂存问题</button></div>
    </div><p class="form-hint">仅暂存本页，刷新清空；不会公开发布，不调用 AI。</p></form>
    <div id="discussion-list"></div><p class="notes-empty" id="questions-empty">还没有问题。带着问题继续阅读。</p>
  </div>
  <div id="notes-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="notes-tab" hidden>
    <form id="note-form"><div class="composer">
      <div class="quote-preview" id="note-quote" hidden><span></span><button type="button" data-clear-quote="note" aria-label="取消批注引用">×</button></div>
      <label class="sr-only" for="note-input">记录你的批注</label>
      <textarea id="note-input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="读到这里，你想到了什么？选中原文，可以一起保存。" required></textarea>
      <div class="composer-actions"><button type="button" class="quote-button" data-quote="note" aria-label="引用选中的原文"><Icon name="quote" /></button><button type="button" id="cancel-edit" hidden>取消编辑</button><button type="submit" class="solid-button" id="save-note">保存批注</button></div>
    </div><p class="form-hint">只存当前浏览器，不是私密账号空间，不跨设备同步。请勿记录敏感信息；清理数据前请导出。</p></form>
    <p class="storage-warning" id="storage-warning" role="status" hidden></p>
    <div id="notes-list"></div><div class="notes-toolbar"><span id="notes-count">0 条批注</span><button type="button" id="export-notes">导出 Markdown</button></div>
  </div>
</section>
